msgstr "名称"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:10
msgid "time - run programs and summarize system resource usage"
msgstr "time - 运行程序并汇总系统资源使用情况"

#. type: SH
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "概述"

#. type: TP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<time>"
msgstr "B<time>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:21
msgid "[ B<-apqvV> ] [ B<-f>I< FORMAT> ] [ B<-o>I< FILE> ]"
msgstr "[ B<-apqvV> ] [ B<-f>I< 格式> ] [ B<-o>I< 文件> ]"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:31
msgid "[ B<--append> ] [ B<--verbose> ] [ B<--quiet> ] [ B<--portability> ]"
msgstr "[ B<--append> ] [ B<--verbose> ] [ B<--quiet> ] [ B<--portability> ]"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:39
msgid "[ B<--format=>I<FORMAT> ] [ B<--output=>I<FILE> ] [ B<--version> ]"
msgstr "[ B<--format=>I<格式> ] [ B<--output=>I<文件> ] [ B<--version> ]"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:47
msgid "[ B<--help> ] I<COMMAND> [ I<ARGS> ]"
msgstr "[ B<--help> ] I<命令> [ I<参数> ]"

#. type: groff code
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ".if  n .ad l\n"
msgstr ".if  n .ad l\n"

#. For nroff, turn off justification.
#. type: SH
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "描述"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:67
msgid ""
"B<time> run the program I<COMMAND> with any given arguments I<ARG...>.  "
"When I<COMMAND> finishes, B<time> displays information about resources "
"used by I<COMMAND> (on the standard error output, by default).  If "
"I<COMMAND> exits with non-zero status, B<time> displays a warning message"
" and the exit status."
msgstr ""
"B<time> 运行程序 I<COMMAND>，并向其传递给定的参数 I<ARG...>。当 I<COMMAND> 结束后，B<time> 会显示"
" I<COMMAND> 所使用的资源信息（默认输出到标准错误）。如果 I<COMMAND> 以非零状态退出，B<time> "
"会显示一条警告消息和退出状态。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:79
msgid ""
"B<time> determines which information to display about the resources used "
"by the I<COMMAND> from the string I<FORMAT>.  If no format is specified "
"on the command line, but the B<TIME> environment variable is set, its "
"value is used as the format.  Otherwise, a default format built into "
"B<time> is used."
msgstr ""
"B<time> 根据字符串 I<FORMAT> 决定显示 I<COMMAND> 使用资源的哪些信息。如果命令行未指定格式，但设置了 B<TIME>"
" 环境变量，则使用其值作为格式。否则，使用 B<time> 内置的默认格式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:88
msgid ""
"Options to B<time> must appear on the command line before I<COMMAND>.  "
"Anything on the command line after I<COMMAND> is passed as arguments to "
"I<COMMAND>."
msgstr "B<time> 的选项必须出现在命令行中 I<COMMAND> 之前。I<COMMAND> 之后的任何内容都会作为参数传递给 I<COMMAND>。"

#. type: SH
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "选项"

#. type: TP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-o>I< FILE, >B<--output=>I<FILE >"
msgstr "B<-o>I< 文件, >B<--output=>I<文件 >"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:98
msgid ""
"Write the resource use statistics to I<FILE> instead of to the standard "
"error stream.  By default, this overwrites the file, destroying the "
"file's previous contents.  This option is useful for collecting "
"information on interactive programs and programs that produce output on "
"the standard error stream."
msgstr ""
"将资源使用统计信息写入 "
"I<FILE>，而不是标准错误流。默认情况下，这会覆盖文件，销毁文件原有内容。此选项适用于收集交互式程序以及向标准错误流输出内容的程序的资源信息。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-a>, B<--append>"
msgstr "B<-a>, B<--append>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:102
msgid ""
"Append the resource use information to the output file instead of "
"overwriting it.  This option is only useful with the `-o' or `--output' "
"option."
msgstr "将资源使用信息追加到输出文件，而不是覆盖它。此选项仅与 `-o' 或 `--output' 选项一起使用时有效。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-f>I< FORMAT, >B<--format>I< FORMAT >"
msgstr "B<-f>I< 格式, >B<--format>I< 格式 >"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:109
msgid ""
"Use I<FORMAT> as the format string that controls the output of B<time>.  "
"See the below more information."
msgstr "使用 I<FORMAT> 作为控制 B<time> 输出的格式字符串。更多信息见下文。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:112
msgid "Print a summary of the command line options and exit."
msgstr "打印命令行选项摘要并退出。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-p>, B<--portability>"
msgstr "B<-p>, B<--portability>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:118
#, no-wrap, python-format
msgid ""
"Use the following format string, for conformance with POSIX standard "
"1003.2:\n"
"          real %e\n"
"          user %U\n"
"          sys %S\n"
msgstr ""
"使用以下格式字符串，以符合 POSIX 1003.2 标准：\n"
"          real %e\n"
"          user %U\n"
"          sys %S\n"

#. type: TP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-v>, B<--verbose>"
msgstr "B<-v>, B<--verbose>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:123
msgid ""
"Use the built-in verbose format, which displays each available piece of "
"information on the program's resource use on its own line, with an "
"English description of its meaning."
msgstr "使用内置的详细格式，将程序资源使用的每项可用信息单独显示在一行上，并用英文说明其含义。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--quiet>"
msgstr "B<--quiet>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:126
msgid "Do not report the status of the program even if it is different from zero."
msgstr "即使程序状态不为零，也不报告该状态。"

#. type: TP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-V>, B<--version>"
msgstr "B<-V>, B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:131
msgid "Print the version number of B<time> and exit."
msgstr "打印 B<time> 的版本号并退出。"

#. type: SH
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "FORMATTING THE OUTPUT"
msgstr "格式化输出"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:145
#, no-wrap, python-format
msgid ""
"The format string\n"
"I<FORMAT>\n"
"controls the contents of the\n"
"B<time>\n"
"output.  The format string can be set using the `-f' or `--format', `-v' "
"or\n"
"`--verbose', or `-p' or `--portability' options.  If they are not\n"
"given, but the\n"
"I<TIME>\n"
"environment variable is set, its value is used as the format string.\n"
"Otherwise, a built-in default format is used.  The default format is:\n"
"  %Uuser %Ssystem %Eelapsed %PCPU (%Xtext+%Ddata %Mmax)k\n"
"  %Iinputs+%Ooutputs (%Fmajor+%Rminor)pagefaults %Wswaps\n"
msgstr ""
"格式字符串\n"
"I<FORMAT>\n"
"控制\n"
"B<time>\n"
"输出的内容。格式字符串可以通过 `-f' 或 `--format'、`-v' 或\n"
"`--verbose'、或者 `-p' 或 `--portability' 选项设置。如果未给出这些选项，但设置了\n"
"I<TIME>\n"
"环境变量，则使用其值作为格式字符串。\n"
"否则，使用内置的默认格式。默认格式为：\n"
"  %Uuser %Ssystem %Eelapsed %PCPU (%Xtext+%Ddata %Mmax)k\n"
"  %Iinputs+%Ooutputs (%Fmajor+%Rminor)pagefaults %Wswaps\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:152
msgid ""
"The format string usually consists of `resource specifiers' interspersed "
"with plain text.  A percent sign (`%') in the format string causes the "
"following character to be interpreted as a resource specifier, which is "
"similar to the formatting characters in the B<printf>(3)  function."
msgstr ""
"格式字符串通常由“资源说明符”和普通文本交错组成。格式字符串中的百分号（`%'）会使后面的字符被解释为资源说明符，类似于 B<printf>(3)"
" 函数中的格式字符。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:159
msgid ""
"A backslash (`\\e') introduces a `backslash escape', which is translated "
"into a single printing character upon output.  `\\et' outputs a tab "
"character, `\\en' outputs a newline, and `\\e\\e' outputs a backslash.  A"
" backslash followed by any other character outputs a question mark (`?') "
"followed by a backslash, to indicate that an invalid backslash escape was"
" given."
msgstr ""
"反斜杠（`\\e'）引入一个“反斜杠转义”，在输出时会转换为单个可打印字符。`\\et' 输出制表符，`\\en' 输出换行符，`\\e\\e' "
"输出反斜杠。反斜杠后跟任何其他字符时，会输出一个问号（`?'）后跟该反斜杠，表示给出了无效的反斜杠转义。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:165
msgid ""
"Other text in the format string is copied verbatim to the output.  "
"B<time> always prints a newline after printing the resource use "
"information, so normally format strings do not end with a newline "
"character (or `\\en')."
msgstr ""
"格式字符串中的其他文本会原样复制到输出。B<time> 在打印资源使用信息后总会输出一个换行符，因此格式字符串通常不应以换行符（或 "
"`\\en'）结尾。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:172
msgid ""
"There are many resource specifications.  Not all resources are measured "
"by all versions of Unix, so some of the values might be reported as zero."
"  Any character following a percent sign that is not listed in the table "
"below causes a question mark (`?') to be output, followed by that "
"character, to indicate that an invalid resource specifier was given."
msgstr ""
"资源说明符很多。并非所有 Unix "
"版本都会测量所有资源，因此某些值可能报告为零。百分号后跟的任何未在下表中列出的字符，都会输出一个问号（`?'）后跟该字符，表示给出了无效的资源说明符。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:179
msgid ""
"The resource specifiers, which are a superset of those recognized by the "
"B<tcsh>(1)  builtin `time' command, are:"
msgstr "资源说明符是 B<tcsh>(1) 内建 `time' 命令所识别说明符的超集，包括："

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:180
#, no-wrap
msgid "%"
msgstr "%"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:182
msgid "A literal `%'."
msgstr "字面百分号 `%'。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:182
#, no-wrap
msgid "C"
msgstr "C"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:184
msgid "Name and command line arguments of the command being timed."
msgstr "被计时命令的名称和命令行参数。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:184
#, no-wrap
msgid "D"
msgstr "D"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:186
msgid "Average size of the process's unshared data area, in Kilobytes."
msgstr "进程非共享数据区的平均大小，单位为千字节。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:186
#, no-wrap
msgid "E"
msgstr "E"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:188
msgid ""
"Elapsed real (wall clock) time used by the process, in "
"[hours:]minutes:seconds."
msgstr "进程使用的实际（挂钟）时间，格式为 [小时:]分钟:秒。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:188
#, no-wrap
msgid "F"
msgstr "F"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:192
msgid ""
"Number of major, or I/O-requiring, page faults that occurred while the "
"process was running.  These are faults where the page has actually "
"migrated out of primary memory."
msgstr "进程运行期间发生的 major（需要 I/O 的）缺页次数。这类缺页是指页面实际已从主存中移出。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:192
#, no-wrap
msgid "I"
msgstr "I"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:194
msgid "Number of file system inputs by the process."
msgstr "进程的文件系统输入次数。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:194
#, no-wrap
msgid "K"
msgstr "K"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:197
msgid "Average total (data+stack+text) memory use of the process, in Kilobytes."
msgstr "进程的平均总内存使用量（数据+栈+文本），单位为千字节。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:197
#, no-wrap
msgid "M"
msgstr "M"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:200
msgid ""
"Maximum resident set size of the process during its lifetime, in "
"Kilobytes."
msgstr "进程生命周期内的最大常驻集大小，单位为千字节。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:200
#, no-wrap
msgid "O"
msgstr "O"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:202
msgid "Number of file system outputs by the process."
msgstr "进程的文件系统输出次数。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:202
#, no-wrap
msgid "P"
msgstr "P"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:206
msgid ""
"Percentage of the CPU that this job got.  This is just user + system "
"times divided by the total running time.  It also prints a percentage "
"sign."
msgstr "此任务获得的 CPU 百分比。它等于用户时间加系统时间除以总运行时间。它还会打印一个百分号。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:206
#, no-wrap
msgid "R"
msgstr "R"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:211
msgid ""
"Number of minor, or recoverable, page faults.  These are pages that are "
"not valid (so they fault) but which have not yet been claimed by other "
"virtual pages.  Thus the data in the page is still valid but the system "
"tables must be updated."
msgstr "minor（可恢复）缺页次数。这些页面无效（因此会触发缺页），但尚未被其他虚拟页面占用。因此页面中的数据仍然有效，但系统表必须更新。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:211
#, no-wrap
msgid "S"
msgstr "S"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:214
msgid ""
"Total number of CPU-seconds used by the system on behalf of the process "
"(in kernel mode), in seconds."
msgstr "系统代表进程（在内核模式下）使用的 CPU 秒总数，单位为秒。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:214
#, no-wrap
msgid "U"
msgstr "U"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:217
msgid ""
"Total number of CPU-seconds that the process used directly (in user "
"mode), in seconds."
msgstr "进程直接（在用户模式下）使用的 CPU 秒总数，单位为秒。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:217
#, no-wrap
msgid "W"
msgstr "W"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:219
msgid "Number of times the process was swapped out of main memory."
msgstr "进程被换出主存的次数。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:219
#, no-wrap
msgid "X"
msgstr "X"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:221
msgid "Average amount of shared text in the process, in Kilobytes."
msgstr "进程中共享文本的平均量，单位为千字节。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:221
#, no-wrap
msgid "Z"
msgstr "Z"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:224
msgid ""
"System's page size, in bytes.  This is a per-system constant, but varies "
"between systems."
msgstr "系统的页面大小，单位为字节。这是每个系统的常量，但不同系统之间可能不同。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:224
#, no-wrap
msgid "c"
msgstr "c"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:227
msgid ""
"Number of times the process was context-switched involuntarily (because "
"the time slice expired)."
msgstr "进程被非自愿上下文切换的次数（因为时间片用完）。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "e"
msgstr "e"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:229
msgid "Elapsed real (wall clock) time used by the process, in seconds."
msgstr "进程使用的实际（挂钟）时间，单位为秒。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:229
#, no-wrap
msgid "k"
msgstr "k"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:231
msgid "Number of signals delivered to the process."
msgstr "传递给进程的信号数量。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:231
#, no-wrap
msgid "p"
msgstr "p"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:233
msgid "Average unshared stack size of the process, in Kilobytes."
msgstr "进程的平均非共享栈大小，单位为千字节。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:233
#, no-wrap
msgid "r"
msgstr "r"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:235
msgid "Number of socket messages received by the process."
msgstr "进程接收的套接字消息数量。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:235
#, no-wrap
msgid "s"
msgstr "s"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:237
msgid "Number of socket messages sent by the process."
msgstr "进程发送的套接字消息数量。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:237
#, no-wrap
msgid "t"
msgstr "t"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:239
msgid "Average resident set size of the process, in Kilobytes."
msgstr "进程的平均常驻集大小，单位为千字节。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:239
#, no-wrap
msgid "w"
msgstr "w"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:242
msgid ""
"Number of times that the program was context-switched voluntarily, for "
"instance while waiting for an I/O operation to complete."
msgstr "程序被自愿上下文切换的次数，例如等待 I/O 操作完成时。"

#. type: IP
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:242
#, no-wrap
msgid "x"
msgstr "x"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:244
msgid "Exit status of the command."
msgstr "命令的退出状态。"

#. type: SH
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:246
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr "示例"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:249
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To run the command `wc /etc/hosts' and show the default information:\n"
"     time wc /etc/hosts\n"
msgstr ""
"要运行命令 `wc /etc/hosts' 并显示默认信息：\n"
"     time wc /etc/hosts\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:253
#, no-wrap, python-format
msgid ""
"To run the command `ls -Fs' and show just the user, system, and total\n"
"time:\n"
"     time -f \"\\et%E real,\\et%U user,\\et%S sys\" ls -Fs\n"
msgstr ""
"要运行命令 `ls -Fs' 并仅显示用户、系统和总时间：\n"
"     time -f \"\\et%E real,\\et%U user,\\et%S sys\" ls -Fs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:260
#, no-wrap, python-format
msgid ""
"To edit the file BORK and have `time' append the elapsed time and\n"
"number of signals to the file `log', reading the format string from the\n"
"environment variable `TIME':\n"
"     export TIME=\"\\et%E,\\et%k\" # If using bash or ksh\n"
"     setenv TIME \"\\et%E,\\et%k\" # If using csh or tcsh\n"
"     time -a -o log emacs bork\n"
msgstr ""
"要编辑文件 BORK，并让 `time' 将实际耗时和信号数量追加到文件 `log'，同时从环境变量 `TIME' 读取格式字符串：\n"
"     export TIME=\"\\et%E,\\et%k\" # 如果使用 bash 或 ksh\n"
"     setenv TIME \"\\et%E,\\et%k\" # 如果使用 csh 或 tcsh\n"
"     time -a -o log emacs bork\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:271
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Users of the\n"
"B<bash>\n"
"shell need to use an explicit path in order to run the external\n"
"B<time>\n"
"command and not the shell builtin variant.  On system where\n"
"B<time>\n"
"is installed in\n"
"I</usr/bin>,\n"
"the first example would become\n"
"     /usr/bin/time wc /etc/hosts\n"
msgstr ""
"B<bash> shell 的用户需要使用显式路径来运行外部 B<time> 命令，而不是 shell 内建版本。在 B<time> 安装于 "
"I</usr/bin> 的系统上，第一个示例会变为\n"
"     /usr/bin/time wc /etc/hosts\n"

#. type: SH
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:272
#, no-wrap
msgid "ACCURACY"
msgstr "精确度"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:281
msgid ""
"The elapsed time is not collected atomically with the execution of the "
"program; as a result, in bizarre circumstances (if the B<time> command "
"gets stopped or swapped out in between when the program being timed exits"
" and when B<time> calculates how long it took to run), it could be much "
"larger than the actual execution time."
msgstr ""
"实际耗时并非与程序执行原子地收集；因此在异常情况下（如果 B<time> 命令在被计时程序退出与 B<time> "
"计算运行时长之间被停止或换出），它可能远大于实际执行时间。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:285
msgid ""
"When the running time of a command is very nearly zero, some values "
"(e.g., the percentage of CPU used) may be reported as either zero (which "
"is wrong) or a question mark."
msgstr "当命令的运行时间非常接近零时，某些值（例如 CPU 使用百分比）可能报告为零（这是错误的）或问号。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:302
msgid ""
"Most information shown by B<time> is derived from the B<wait3>(2)  system"
" call.  The numbers are only as good as those returned by B<wait3>(2).  "
"On systems that do not have a B<wait3>(2)  call that returns status "
"information, the B<times>(2)  system call is used instead.  However, it "
"provides much less information than B<wait3>(2), so on those systems "
"B<time> reports the majority of the resources as zero."
msgstr ""
"B<time> 显示的大部分信息来自 B<wait3>(2) 系统调用。这些数字的准确度取决于 B<wait3>(2) "
"返回的值。在没有返回状态信息的 B<wait3>(2) 调用的系统上，会改用 B<times>(2) 系统调用。然而，它提供的信息远少于 "
"B<wait3>(2)，因此在这些系统上 B<time> 会将大多数资源报告为零。"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:307
msgid ""
"The `%I' and `%O' values are allegedly only `real' input and output and "
"do not include those supplied by caching devices.  The meaning of `real' "
"I/O reported by `%I' and `%O' may be muddled for workstations, especially"
" diskless ones."
msgstr ""
"据称 `%I' 和 `%O' 值仅包含“真实”输入和输出，不包括缓存设备提供的数据。对于工作站，尤其是无盘工作站，`%I' 和 `%O' "
"报告的“真实”I/O 含义可能比较混乱。"

#. type: SH
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:308
#, no-wrap
msgid "DIAGNOSTICS"
msgstr "诊断"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:317
msgid ""
"The B<time> command returns when the program exits, stops, or is "
"terminated by a signal.  If the program exited normally, the return value"
" of B<time> is the return value of the program it executed and measured."
"  Otherwise, the return value is 128 plus the number of the signal which "
"caused the program to stop or terminate."
msgstr ""
"B<time> 命令在程序退出、停止或被信号终止时返回。如果程序正常退出，B<time> 的返回值就是它所执行并测量的程序的返回值。否则，返回值为"
" 128 加上导致程序停止或终止的信号编号。"

#. type: SH
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:317
#, no-wrap
msgid "AUTHOR"
msgstr "作者"

#. type: Plain text
#: raw/time/man1/time.1:322
msgid ""
"B<time> was written by David MacKenzie.  This man page was added by Dirk "
"Eddelbuettel E<lt>edd@debian.orgE<gt>, the Debian GNU/Linux maintainer, "
"for use by the Debian GNU/Linux distribution but may of course be used by"
" others."
msgstr ""
"B<time> 由 David MacKenzie 编写。本手册页由 Debian GNU/Linux 维护者 Dirk Eddelbuettel"
" E<lt>edd@debian.orgE<gt> 添加，供 Debian GNU/Linux 发行版使用，当然也可以供其他人使用。"

